concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 After subsection 6(2E)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (2F) In addition to the effect that this Act (other than Parts IIIA, VIIA and X) has as provided by another subsection of this section, this Act (other than Parts IIIA, VIIA and X) has, by force of this subsection, the effect it would have if:  (a) each reference in Part IVC to a payment surcharge were a reference to a payment surcharge charged for processing a payment made by means of a postal, telegraphic, telephonic, or other like service (including electronic communication); and  (b) each reference to a corporation included a reference to a person not being a corporation." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (2F) In addition to the effect that this Act (other than Parts IIIA, VIIA and X) has as provided by another subsection of this section, this Act (other than Parts IIIA, VIIA and X) has, by force of this subsection, the effect it would have if:  (a) each reference in Part IVC to a payment surcharge were a reference to a payment surcharge charged for processing a payment made by means of a postal, telegraphic, telephonic, or other like service (including electronic communication); and  (b) each reference to a corporation included a reference to a person not being a corporation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b74f20b6e1145b2c7bfb4ff20ab8bc907bebd476cd012717281f32196acef345" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inserts new subsection 2F with specific effects on the Act." ;
