concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-55c-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55C(4) Surcharge information notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-55c-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The surcharge information notice must specify: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2016A00009  Schedule 1  Amendments  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Payment Surcharges) Act No. 9, 2016  (a) the kinds of information or documents to be given to the Commission; and  (b) the period for giving the information or documents." ;
