concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-55f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55F Purpose and effect of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-55f ;
    values:originalText "(1) The purpose of this Division is to provide for the issue of an infringement notice to a person for an alleged contravention of section 55B as an alternative to proceedings for an order under section 76 for the payment of a pecuniary penalty.  (2) This Division does not:  (a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an alleged contravention of section 55B; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2016A00009  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 9, 2016 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Payment Surcharges) Act  (b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under section 76 in relation to an alleged contravention of section 55B if:  (i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the contravention; or  (ii) an infringement notice issued to the person for the contravention is withdrawn under section 55N; or  (c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the penalty specified in the infringement notice if the person does not comply with the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The purpose of this Division is to provide for the issue of an infringement notice to a person for an alleged contravention of section 55B as an alternative to proceedings for an order under section 76 for the payment of a pecuniary penalty.  (2) This Division does not:  (a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an alleged contravention of section 55B; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2016A00009  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 9, 2016 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Payment Surcharges) Act  (b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under section 76 in relation to an alleged contravention of section 55B if:  (i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the contravention; or  (ii) an infringement notice issued to the person for the contravention is withdrawn under section 55N; or  (c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the penalty specified in the infringement notice if the person does not comply with the notice."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7328b921b139828b41bfaf25187427af88ac79b4b26a9cbc0a60714edddc5d06" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-55f-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-55f-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
