concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-55m-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55M(6) Infringement notice compliance period for infringement notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-55m-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Division to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Division to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended."@en ;
