concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-payment-surcharges-act-2016-sch-1-sec-18 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 After subsection 87(1B)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-18 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1BAA) The Commission may make an application under paragraph (1A)(b) on behalf of a class of persons identified in the application who have suffered, or are likely to suffer, loss or damage by conduct of another person that was engaged in in contravention of section 55B.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 3 December 2015 Senate on 4 February 2016]  (210/15) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2016A00009" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1BAA) The Commission may make an application under paragraph (1A)(b) on behalf of a class of persons identified in the application who have suffered, or are likely to suffer, loss or damage by conduct of another person that was engaged in in contravention of section 55B.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 3 December 2015 Senate on 4 February 2016]  (210/15) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2016A00009"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d6ea0bb3694921983c60e4dbf5adff5e6577c0a42e4056c094d15680c8c84172" ;
